{"v":4,"catch":"走吧，白怒火！ 擊敗半機械忍者軍隊！","desc":"《未来忍者》(MIRAI NINJA)是《NAMCO》於1988年發售的動作遊戲。\n控制機器人忍者“白怒火”，從綁架她的機器人忍者軍隊中救出咲公主。\n在關卡中撿起球體以激活有助於不知火的各種效果。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-12-16","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/49034c2fb03d51b62eaef9eac1863b08e35a2e00a0ece63c8a1b2fd2c954861b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/653e6da6b67e28cdebf565aac135993eb6d0ec4f9a871bd9a2430e04eb027a6d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/779cd790adf32ec89ea9d21eddf1dcab17dbc43d43f240cca424349642f1c727.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19eb4efabb7493d3888fee4bca3843bf07aee71a3c810521c5551e14310fdaa2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e810460c5fff14d06ff2ce779bfe9cfb165824fc361b9cdea4f342aa00a8c9ac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/022997af029a3eb5b4112f3563186de0880a8e5bf7b76c0c290b22f1df96dbf8.jpg"],"titleId":"01000d50169c4000","dlc":[]}